#. Placeholders to leave as they are: {{kalliope.version}}
#: index.html non-ancora/index.html
#, kalliope-markup, python-brace-format
msgctxt "apertura.stato"
msgid "<1>Oggi:</1> versione di prova {{kalliope.version}}, solo per Linux (x86_64 con PipeWire). Non ancora provata in una riunione vera con Zoom, Teams o Meet."
msgstr "<1>आज:</1> परीक्षण संस्करण {{kalliope.version}}, केवल Linux के लिए (x86_64 और PipeWire के साथ)। अभी Zoom, Teams या Meet की किसी असली मीटिंग में परखा नहीं गया।"

#. Shown instead of the sentence of the key apertura.stato when the release is not a test version: the same sentence without «of test». The site chooses one of the two by the release data.
#. Tags in the text (move the words, keep every tag, each inside the same tag):
#.   <1> = <strong>
#. Placeholders to leave as they are: {{kalliope.version}}
#: index.html non-ancora/index.html
#, kalliope-markup, python-brace-format
msgctxt "apertura.stato-stabile"
msgid "<1>Oggi:</1> versione {{kalliope.version}}, solo per Linux (x86_64 con PipeWire). Non ancora provata in una riunione vera con Zoom, Teams o Meet."
msgstr "<1>आज:</1> संस्करण {{kalliope.version}}, केवल Linux के लिए (x86_64 और PipeWire के साथ)। अभी Zoom, Teams या Meet की किसी असली मीटिंग में परखा नहीं गया।"

